('P26','FSC-251','en','Know the Ingredient','A school team must improve a water station. The team asks you to solve a know the ingredient problem using evidence rather than guesswork.','Define the question, collect/read relevant evidence, make at least one calculation or structured comparison, identify a limitation and justify the preferred action.','Evidence table, calculation/graph where appropriate, decision and justification.','Fair comparison; correct units/reading; evidence supports conclusion; limitation is acknowledged.','Use only teacher-approved materials. No tasting is required. Follow school rules for food handling, allergies, handwashing and sanitation. Teachers control knives, heat, electrical equipment, chemicals and processing machinery.',true),
